    <panel_attributes>title=SD04 Answer with retrieved citations
fontsize=14
obj=GUI or CLI~u
obj=AgentFacade~f
obj=QuestionAnswerService~s
obj=RetrievalStrategy~r
obj=LLMClient~l
obj=ResponseParser~p
obj=CitationValidator~v

u-&gt;f : askQuestion(courseId, question)
f-&gt;s : answer(course, question)
s:Clarify a vague request before retrieval
s-&gt;r : retrieve(question, chunks, k)
r.&gt;s : relevant chunks
s:With no relevant chunks return a notice without a model call
s-&gt;l : generate(qaPrompt with retrieved IDs)
l.&gt;s : LLMResponse
s-&gt;p : parseCitedAnswer(text)
p.&gt;s : answer text and cited IDs
s-&gt;v : validate(ids, retrieved)
v.&gt;s : allowed IDs only
s.&gt;u : Answer with file and page or line locations
s:Citation membership does not prove semantic support for every sentence</panel_attributes>
